  {B}ittyOS @VERSION@{R}  -  lightweight Linux system
  {D}package manager: flowkit  |  antivirus: ClamAV{R}

  {CY}flowkit -h{R}          package manager help
  {CY}flowkit -i <pkg>{R}  install a package (virus-checked)
  {CY}flowkit scan{R}        scan the system for viruses
  {CY}neofetch{R}            system information
  {CY}install-ittyos{R}      install ittyOS to disk

